ve to have  started and we're hoping to roll out in  the next few years  so here's a question i think you've  partially answered this but clearly it's  on people's minds is there an  anticipated timeline for implementation  of legislative opportunities for  landowners under the clcpa  so the  in terms of the plan the plan the  scoping plan will be  you know out for public comment  all  you know for a period of time next year  um i'm not sure exactly at the timeline  that that's going to be out i think it  will be you know 120 160 day comment  period  and the  plan is to finalize that by 2023  and so then you know we would hope that  the implementation of those  recommendations would come soon after  that  um you know i think dec has a lot of  programs in this area which i  highlighted as well and you know we're  already you know moving forward and  trying to integrate carbon management  into those programs as quickly as  possible so what we're able to do  without legislative approval um we're  moving forward with within our dec  programs currently  well thanks brian  this has been a production of cornell  university on the web at cornell.edu


